# LAYERS (0.16.20, DJ MOVES' fourth knob): the groove arranged on its 8-bar phrase lines, a part out for a phrase and back on the next. Busy, no
# auto-DJ: within a few phrases a part goes out (the engine hears it; the player's own mutes stay untouched); a breakdown brings everything back; the
# first phrase after a drop plays full; Off: nothing out.
seed 0
wait 3000
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 3
wait 100
expect fxpage 35
spin K4 2
wait 50
expect fxs99 2
tap FX
wait 200
expect arm 0
# a part out within a few phrases (16 s a phrase at this tempo, seven in ten taken)
waitfor arm >0 120000
wait 100
expect entrkmute >0
expect trkmute 0
tap HOME
wait 200
shot layers_perform.png
tap HOME
wait 200
# a breakdown by hand: everything back
tap SAVE
waitfor sec 1 5000
wait 100
expect arm 0
expect entrkmute 0
# the build, and its drop
tap SAVE
waitfor sec 2 5000
waitfor sec 0 20000
# the drop's first phrase plays full (6 bars of it)
wait 12000
expect arm 0
# off: nothing out, however long
press HOME
wait 800
release HOME
wait 100
turn SELECT 3
wait 100
expect fxpage 35
spin K4 -2
wait 50
expect fxs99 0
tap FX
wait 200
wait 60000
expect arm 0
expect entrkmute 0
